{"unit_id":"BREEY05__dsh-balance-widget#card-zh","repo":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget","commit":"86494fb9d9688805c13a42c9e54bdf99dd428e88","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 API 余额与消费观察插件。它在对话输入框下方注册余额入口，并由 Host 受保护路由读取当前模型供应商的余额。支持 AIGoCode、Taffy、DeepSeek 官方及 DeepSeek 账号钱包，也能按 profile 配置发现其他供应商的余额接口。面板展示可用余额、充值和赠金、会话与今日估算消耗，并提供刷新及用量链接。适合需要在 DSH 对话中查看模型账户额度的人；供应商 API 余额需要相应凭据，DeepSeek 账号钱包使用 DSH 账号登录。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:632-649","index.js:345-370","index.js:21-52"]}
{"unit_id":"BREEY05__dsh-balance-widget#card-en","repo":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget","commit":"86494fb9d9688805c13a42c9e54bdf99dd428e88","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget shows provider balance in a DSH web composer pill. The panel lists credit and estimated session and daily spend, with refresh and usage links. Host routes read known providers or discover balances from profile settings. Provider credentials or DSH sign-in are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:632-649","index.js:345-370","index.js:21-52"]}
