{"unit_id":"BREEY05__dsh-balance-widget#feature-1","repo":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget","commit":"86494fb9d9688805c13a42c9e54bdf99dd428e88","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget 的功能「输入框余额入口」：在对话 composer dock 注册可点击的余额 pill，显示当前供应商和可用额度；点开后展示余额详情与操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:632-649"]}
{"unit_id":"BREEY05__dsh-balance-widget#feature-2","repo":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget","commit":"86494fb9d9688805c13a42c9e54bdf99dd428e88","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget 的功能「供应商余额读取」：Host 按已知供应商路由或 profile 中的 baseURL 探测余额接口，使用凭据请求并解析余额数值及币种。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:253-320"]}
{"unit_id":"BREEY05__dsh-balance-widget#feature-3","repo":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget","commit":"86494fb9d9688805c13a42c9e54bdf99dd428e88","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget 的功能「消费估算」：客户端比较同一供应商钱包的前后余额，将下降额累计为当前会话和今日消费，并在面板中显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:439-469","client.js:608-630"]}
{"unit_id":"BREEY05__dsh-balance-widget#feature-4","repo":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget","commit":"86494fb9d9688805c13a42c9e54bdf99dd428e88","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget 的功能「未知供应商自动发现」：对 profile 中配置了 baseURL 的新供应商，按常见余额路径逐个请求并缓存找到的接口，供通用余额路由读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:54-65","index.js:132-155","index.js:264-284"]}
{"unit_id":"BREEY05__dsh-balance-widget#feature-5","repo":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget","commit":"86494fb9d9688805c13a42c9e54bdf99dd428e88","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget 的功能「余额与消费详情」：点击余额入口打开面板，可查看充值余额、赠金、本会话和今日消耗，并使用刷新按钮或可用的用量、充值链接。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:715-758"]}
{"unit_id":"BREEY05__dsh-balance-widget#caveat-1","repo":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget","commit":"86494fb9d9688805c13a42c9e54bdf99dd428e88","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget 使用余额下降估算消费，并将记录保存在浏览器存储；共享账户的其他设备消费也可能被计入，数值不等同供应商账单。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:11-14","client.js:439-469"]}
{"unit_id":"BREEY05__dsh-balance-widget#caveat-2","repo":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget","commit":"86494fb9d9688805c13a42c9e54bdf99dd428e88","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"BREEY05/dsh-balance-widget 会以配置的 API Key 向供应商域名请求余额；自动发现还会探测相同 baseURL 下多个余额路径，相关请求会出现在供应商访问记录中。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:132-155","index.js:287-293"]}
